# Standalone dch (debchange) for build hosts without devscripts.
#
# Temporary workaround: 
# helpers/config fails with "dch: command not found". If dch is missing,
# helpers/config uses ./dch from here instead. The system dch is always
# preferred when it is installed.
#
# Contents:
#   usr/        verbatim, unmodified files from Trisquel's devscripts package,
#               keeping the package paths. Do not edit anything under usr/.
#   SHA256SUMS  checksums of the files under usr/, same paths as in the .deb.
#   SOURCE      this file: where the files come from.
#   dch         wrapper: refuses to run if usr/ does not match SHA256SUMS.
#   verify.sh   audit script: checksums, signed archive chain, and
#               byte-for-byte output against the system dch.
#
# Requirements: perl and libdpkg-perl, already needed by dpkg-source and
# dpkg-parsechangelog. Without them the build fails, as intended.
#
# Removal: revert the commit that added this directory, or just delete
# helpers/DATA/standalone/devscripts. With the directory gone the hook in
# helpers/config does nothing, and a builder without dch fails as before.
#
# Refresh: download the new .deb from the archive below, extract it with
# dpkg-deb -x, copy the same three files, regenerate SHA256SUMS, update the
# fields below, then run ./verify.sh.
#
# License: devscripts is GPL-2+, see the header of each file under usr/.
# Dates are UTC.

